Package: PopGenMapper
Title: Validate and Visualize Population Ancestry
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Pauline", "Owusu-Ansah",
    email = "paulineowusu653@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validates sample identifiers, ancestry proportions, and geographic
    coordinates. Draws individual ancestry barplots and regional geographic
    pie maps with consistent cluster colors. Includes fictional example data
    for learning and development.
Imports: graphics, grDevices
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/codewithPauline/PopGenMapper
BugReports: https://github.com/codewithPauline/PopGenMapper/issues
